          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಶ್ಲಾಘಿಸು — ślāghisu — \"to commend\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಊರಿನ ಜನರು ಆ ಹುಡುಗನ ಧೈರ್ಯವನ್ನು ಶ್ಲಾಘಿಸಿದರು. ūrina janaru ā huḍugana dhairyavannu ślāghisidaru. The villagers commended the boy's courage."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (I …): ಶ್ಲಾಘಿಸಿದೆ, ślāghiside."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "What is commended takes -ಅನ್ನು. ಶ್ಲಾಘನೀಯ, praiseworthy."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಶ್ಲಾಘಿಸು (ślāghisu) is built on Sanskrit ślāghā, \"boasting; praise\" (CDIAL 12736), with the Kannada verb ending -isu."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
